h Pixel Art World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world both beautiful and chilling, balanced between dream and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hypnotic, adaptive OST that enhances the game\u2019s oppressive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Skins and Customization Options</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your hero with unique outfits and visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden and Playful Easter Eggs</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted and funny secrets await the most persistent explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.poster.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.webm?t=1770089660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.mp4?t=1770089660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A responsive, relentless gameplay loop where every decision matters and adrenaline never fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized for Controller (Keyboard/Mouse Supported)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-precise controls, tailored for gamepads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapters as Fragments of Your Mind</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into thematic zones, each exploring a trauma or repressed emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Alternate Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes your fate: redemption, madness, or eternal recurrence. One thing is certain\u2014your mind will never leave unscathed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Local Multiplayer Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends in fast-paced split-screen battles. Test your reflexes and strategies with different characters and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/df7829ca9ede7a2a2e49eca18f7fd1b5.poster.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/df7829ca9ede7a2a2e49eca18f7fd1b5.webm?t=1770089660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/df7829ca9ede7a2a2e49eca18f7fd1b5.mp4?t=1770089660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a universe between dreams and reality, <strong>Starlight, a hero of light</strong> awakened in darkness, must ascend the skies and confront the surrounding obscurity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you'll meet new endearing, mysterious, and quirky characters, and face mythical creatures that stand in your way. Lost in the unknown and having lost your memory, rekindle Starlight's eternal flame by rediscovering the hero's forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/8d794b72c0e76fbb8520705d94b9e4f2.poster.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/8d794b72c0e76fbb8520705d94b9e4f2.webm?t=1770089660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/8d794b72c0e76fbb8520705d94b9e4f2.mp4?t=1770089660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/b3127c0cdcc36b1fedd13fa36c65d2fe.avif?t=1770089660\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p>","developers":["Speculo","Le_Sims"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":